PROJECT: HIRENEXA AI

AI-Powered Intelligent Recruitment and Interview Platform

1. Project Overview

Build a complete, modern, full-stack web application named HireNexa AI, an AI-powered recruitment platform designed to automate and streamline the hiring and interview process.

The platform should allow companies and recruiters to create job openings, configure interview rounds, invite candidates through secure interview links, conduct AI-powered voice and video interviews using an interactive talking avatar, analyze candidate responses, and generate detailed interview reports.

The system must support three user roles:

1. Super Admin
2. Recruiter
3. Candidate

Develop HireNexa AI as a professional, scalable, secure, and functional recruitment product rather than a static UI demo.

Important: All major features must work end-to-end. Buttons, forms, dashboards, authentication, interview sessions, report generation, and database operations must be connected to their actual functionality.

